## Usage And Boundaries

Exactly two model image opens: one original, one actual complete 640 px preview. One batch; maximum 8 images per batch and 24 per context respected. No reopens, other PASS figures, page grids, old failed crops, paid generation, installs, database calls, external-network requests, agents or chats.

All task writes are confined to this author scratch directory. Existing skill/content/ticket changes were not edited or reverted. One initial read-only `git status --short` occurred; no Git mutation was performed. One exploratory `rg` call exited 1 because zsh rejected an unmatched `scripts/lib*` glob; this was unrelated to a content stage and is recorded in usage.

Finite author work ends at `result.json`.
